# Implementation Plan - Assessment ACGS Summary Cards

We will add a summary dashboard at the top of the **Assessment ACGS** page to provide quick insights into compliance progress, scores, and gaps.

## 1. Mockup Data Structure
We will define a set of mockup data that represents the state of a typical ACGS assessment:

```typescript
const summaryData = {
    // 1. Overall Completion Progress
    progress: {
        total: 128,
        completed: 86,
        percentage: 67
    },
    // 2. Compliance Score
    compliance: {
        score: 84.5,
        trend: "+2.4%",
        status: 'improving'
    },
    // 3. Part-wise Status (Score per Part A-E)
    parts: [
        { id: 'A', name: 'Rights of Shareholders', score: 92, color: '#3b82f6' }, // Blue
        { id: 'B', name: 'Equitable Treatment', score: 75, color: '#10b981' }, // Green
        { id: 'C', name: 'Role of Stakeholders', score: 62, color: '#f59e0b' }, // Amber
        { id: 'D', name: 'Disclosure & Transparency', score: 88, color: '#8b5cf6' }, // Purple
        { id: 'E', name: 'Responsibilities of Board', score: 70, color: '#ec4899' }  // Pink
    ],
    // 4. Evidence Fulfillment
    evidence: {
        total: 128,
        fulfilled: 48,
        percentage: 37.5
    },
    // 5. Gaps & Recommendations
    gaps: {
        total: 12,
        urgent: 4,
