    }
};
```

## 2. Component Design
We will create a new component `src/routes/assessment-acgs/summary-cards.svelte` using:
- **Card UI**: Standard project card components from `$lib/components/ui/card`.
- **Icons**: Lucide icons for visual context (TrendingUp, FileCheck, AlertTriangle, etc.).
- **Chart Mockups**: Simple SVG-based radial progress and micro-bar charts for a premium feel without external heavy libraries.

